  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;该资源包仍在开发中（WIP），待附加组件支持可用后，将添加更多暗色纹理。</p>\n<p><strong>当前支持的附加组件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2WLIB</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 导入导出卡</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded AE</a><br><br>\n<p><strong>免责声明</strong></p>\n<p>这些纹理大多不是我制作的，我从&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 (AE2)</a>&nbsp;获取了这些纹理。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如有需要，可在 Discord 上联系我：void_odyssey</p>\n<p><strong>功能特性</strong></p>\n<p>将许多过暗或存在视觉问题的纹理转换为亮色模式。<br>可选地，新风格的亮色模式纹理也已移植至 1.20.1 版本。</p>\n<p>方块变更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gcjvVRs.png\" alt=\"*方块变更*\" width=\"970\" height=\"771\"></p>\n<p>物品变更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tsRQwTh.png\" alt=\"*物品变更*\" width=\"1296\" height=\"729\"></p>",
